<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MACMED RAISES HALF YR SHR, DIV.</title>
<headline>MACMED RAISES HALF YR SHR, DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	   6.5     vs 3.6</p>
<p>    Shr, fully diluted (cts)  5.6     vs 3.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     2.0     vs 1.0  </p>
<p>    Attrib income		 6.21    vs 2.85</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 8.39    vs 3.09</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.67    vs 0.13</p>
<p>    Interest paid		 0.71    vs 1.18</p>
<p>    Turnover		    101.59    vs 39.76</p>
<p>Div payable Jan 8</p>
<p>on register Nov 29</p>
<p>Full name: Macmed Health Care Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it expected to achieve earnings per</p>
<p>share in excess of 12 cents for the 1997 financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
